      "start": 10.4,
      "duration": 4.48
    },
    {
      "text": "social media, and support group as well",
      "start": 12.88,
      "duration": 4.0
    },
    {
      "text": "as a link to buy me a coffee if you are",
      "start": 14.88,
      "duration": 4.77
    },
    {
      "text": "able. You should not rely on any medical",
      "start": 16.88,
      "duration": 4.0
    },
    {
      "text": "[music] information contained in this",
      "start": 19.65,
      "duration": 3.629
    },
    {
      "text": "podcast and related materials in making",
      "start": 20.88,
      "duration": 4.239
    },
    {
      "text": "medical, health related [music] or other",
      "start": 23.279,
      "duration": 4.881
    },
    {
      "text": "decisions. Please do consult a doctor or",
      "start": 25.119,
      "duration": 5.121
    },
    {
      "text": "other health professional.",
      "start": 28.16,
      "duration": 4.079
    },
    {
      "text": "I love to [music] hear from you. If",
      "start": 30.24,
      "duration": 3.76
    },
    {
      "text": "you've got any suggestions or feedback",
      "start": 32.239,
      "duration": 3.921
    },
    {
      "text": "or just want to say hey, [music] then",
      "start": 34.0,
      "duration": 4.559
    },
    {
      "text": "please do get in touch. I really hope",
      "start": 36.16,
      "duration": 5.76
    },
    {
      "text": "you enjoy this episode. So, here we go.",
      "start": 38.559,
      "duration": 5.381
    },
    {
      "text": "[music]",
      "start": 41.92,
      "duration": 2.02
    },
    {
      "text": ">> [music]",
      "start": 50.435,
      "duration": 2.02
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Hello and welcome back to this episode",
      "start": 56.239,
      "duration": 5.84
    },
    {
      "text": "of the Longco podcast.",
      "start": 58.879,
      "duration": 5.041
    },
    {
      "text": "Today I'm going to talk about something",
      "start": 62.079,
      "duration": 4.241
    },
    {
      "text": "that almost everyone in recovery bumps",
      "start": 63.92,
      "duration": 6.4
    },
    {
      "text": "into sometimes daily and that is",
      "start": 66.32,
      "duration": 6.799
    },
    {
      "text": "overwhelm.",
      "start": 70.32,
      "duration": 5.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Overwhelm can feel like your whole",
      "start": 73.119,
      "duration": 6.401
    },
    {
      "text": "system suddenly says too much.",
      "start": 75.36,
      "duration": 7.68
    },
    {
      "text": "It could feel like too much sensation.",
      "start": 79.52,
      "duration": 6.32
    },
    {
      "text": "It could feel like too much noise,",
      "start": 83.04,
      "duration": 6.719
    },
    {
      "text": "too many decisions, too many feelings,",
      "start": 85.84,
      "duration": 7.36
    },
    {
      "text": "too much uncertainty.",
      "start": 89.759,
      "duration": 6.801
    },
    {
      "text": "And often it builds up over time",
      "start": 93.2,
      "duration": 6.32
    },
    {
      "text": "or it can come on more suddenly.",
      "start": 96.56,
      "duration": 4.72
    },
    {
      "text": "And of course, sometimes it does build",
      "start": 99.52,
      "duration": 4.639
    },
    {
      "text": "up over time and we either ignore it",
      "start": 101.28,
      "duration": 6.159
    },
    {
      "text": "consciously or we don't notice it",
      "start": 104.159,
      "duration": 6.161
    },
    {
      "text": "unconsciously.",
      "start": 107.439,
      "duration": 6.401
    },
    {
      "text": "And if you are recovering from longco,",
      "start": 110.32,
      "duration": 5.119
    },
    {
      "text": "ME/CFS",
      "start": 113.84,
      "duration": 4.0
    },
    {
      "text": "or any postviral condition or health",
      "start": 115.439,
      "duration": 4.32
    },
    {
      "text": "challenge,",
      "start": 117.84,
      "duration": 5.84
    },
    {
      "text": "overwhelm isn't a character flaw.",
      "start": 119.759,
      "duration": 6.801
    },
    {
      "text": "It's a nervous system response, a",
      "start": 123.68,
      "duration": 5.52
    },
    {
      "text": "physical body response.",
      "start": 126.56,
      "duration": 4.88
    },
    {
      "text": "It's not in your head. It's not",
      "start": 129.2,
      "duration": 5.28
    },
    {
      "text": "something you deliberately did wrong. It",
      "start": 131.44,
      "duration": 6.96
    },
    {
      "text": "is your body trying to protect you,",
      "start": 134.48,
      "duration": 5.839
    },
    {
      "text": "even if it doesn't feel like it right",
      "start": 138.4,
      "duration": 4.8
    },
    {
      "text": "now.",
      "start": 140.319,
      "duration": 5.121
    },
    {
      "text": "So, in this short episode today, I want",
      "start": 143.2,
      "duration": 7.039
    },
    {
      "text": "to explore what overwhelm actually is,",
      "start": 145.44,
      "duration": 8.48
    },
    {
      "text": "why it shows up so quickly in recovery,",
      "start": 150.239,
      "duration": 6.64
    },
    {
      "text": "how [snorts] we can work to avoid it,",
      "start": 153.92,
      "duration": 5.599
    },
    {
      "text": "and some gentle practical ways to meet",
      "start": 156.879,
      "duration": 6.08
    },
    {
      "text": "it when it does show up.",
      "start": 159.519,
      "duration": 5.281
    },
    {
      "text": "So, my hope is that you leave this",
      "start": 162.959,
      "duration": 4.881
    },
    {
      "text": "episode feeling less alone, less",
      "start": 164.8,
      "duration": 5.92
    },
    {
      "text": "confused by your own reactions,",
      "start": 167.84,
      "duration": 5.039
    },
    {
      "text": "and more equipped with tools that",
      "start": 170.72,
      "duration": 5.879
    },
    {
      "text": "genuinely help.",
      "start": 172.879,
      "duration": 3.72
    },
    {
      "text": "So,",
      "start": 177.04,
      "duration": 5.52
    },
    {
      "text": "what is overwhelm?",
      "start": 178.72,
      "duration": 6.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Overwhelm is not a mindset. It's not you",
      "start": 182.56,
      "duration": 5.36
    },
    {
      "text": "being dramatic. It's not you failing to",
      "start": 185.36,
      "duration": 5.2
    },
    {
      "text": "cope. Overwhelm",
      "start": 187.92,
      "duration": 7.2
    },
    {
      "text": "is a capacity issue.",
      "start": 190.56,
      "duration": 8.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Your nervous system, my nervous system,",
      "start": 195.12,
      "duration": 6.479
    },
    {
      "text": "everyone else's nervous system has a",
      "start": 198.64,
      "duration": 5.36
    },
    {
      "text": "certain bandwidth.",
      "start": 201.599,
      "duration": 4.241
    },
    {
      "text": "And in each person, in each moment,",
      "start": 204.0,
      "duration": 5.04
    },
    {
      "text": "that's individual.",
      "start": 205.84,
      "duration": 7.119
    },
    {
      "text": "And in long CO or ME/CFS, that bandwidth",
      "start": 209.04,
      "duration": 7.68
    },
    {
      "text": "is often reduced. Not permanently, not",
      "start": 212.959,
      "duration": 5.36
    },
    {
      "text": "irreversibly,",
      "start": 216.72,
      "duration": 5.36
    },
    {
      "text": "but for now, your system has less space",
      "start": 218.319,
      "duration": 6.961
    },
    {
      "text": "to process input.",
      "start": 222.08,
      "duration": 6.239
    },
    {
      "text": "So things that used to feel natural, a",
      "start": 225.28,
      "duration": 6.64
    },
    {
      "text": "conversation, a decision, a noise, an",
      "start": 228.319,
      "duration": 5.441
    },
    {
      "text": "activity,",
      "start": 231.92,
      "duration": 6.879
    },
    {
      "text": "can suddenly feel like too much.",
      "start": 233.76,
      "duration": 6.96
    },
    {
      "text": "When your system starts to reach its",
      "start": 238.799,
      "duration": 5.041
    },
    {
      "text": "limit, it moves into that danger state,",
      "start": 240.72,
      "duration": 6.32
    },
    {
      "text": "what we might call fight flight.",
      "start": 243.84,
      "duration": 5.84
    },
    {
      "text": "That might look like irritability, brain",
      "start": 247.04,
      "duration": 7.6
    },
    {
      "text": "fog, panic, a need to escape, crying for",
      "start": 249.68,
      "duration": 8.16
    },
    {
      "text": "quote unquote no reason, or just feeling",
      "start": 254.64,
      "duration": 7.439
    },
    {
      "text": "like everything is happening too fast.",
      "start": 257.84,
      "duration": 6.88
    },
    {
      "text": "And then as the system hits its limit,",
      "start": 262.079,
      "duration": 6.161
    },
    {
      "text": "it moves into a protected state.",
      "start": 264.72,
      "duration": 6.24
    },
    {
      "text": "what we call shutdown, which might look",
      "start": 268.24,
      "duration": 5.92
    },
    {
      "text": "like the body shutting down,",
      "start": 270.96,
      "duration": 6.0
    },
    {
      "text": "disconnecting from your own body,",
      "start": 274.16,
      "duration": 5.44
    },
    {
      "text": "feeling frozen and stuck, having no",
      "start": 276.96,
      "duration": 5.44
    },
    {
      "text": "energy, being unable to connect with",
      "start": 279.6,
      "duration": 5.36
    },
    {
      "text": "others, avoidance,",
      "start": 282.4,
      "duration": 4.88
    },
    {
      "text": "and our body processing it feeling like",
      "start": 284.96,
      "duration": 7.519
    },
    {
      "text": "they're shutting down or going slow.",
      "start": 287.28,
      "duration": 8.24
    },
    {
      "text": "So when the body can't handle anymore,",
      "start": 292.479,
      "duration": 5.44
    },
    {
      "text": "it tips over into this overwhelm or",
      "start": 295.52,
      "duration": 4.88
    },
    {
      "text": "shutdown state and shuts us down into",
      "start": 297.919,
      "duration": 4.72
    },
    {
      "text": "this immobilization or what we call",
      "start": 300.4,
      "duration": 4.799
    },
    {
      "text": "dorsal veagal nervous [snorts] system",
      "start": 302.639,
      "duration": 7.361
    },
    {
      "text": "state. This is a physiological state.",
      "start": 305.199,
      "duration": 7.121
    },
    {
      "text": "This is your body saying, I can't take",
      "start": 310.0,
      "duration": 5.713
    },
    {
      "text": "in any more information right now.",
      "start": 312.32,
      "duration": 6.4
    },
    {
      "text": "[snorts] And that's not a failure.",
      "start": 315.713,
      "duration": 5.647
    },
    {
      "text": "It's communication.",
      "start": 318.72,
      "duration": 7.64
    },
    {
      "text": "It's our body giving us a message.",
      "start": 321.36,
      "duration": 5.0
    },
    {
      "text": "So why does overwhelm happen in",
      "start": 326.96,
      "duration": 5.28
    },
    {
      "text": "recovery?",
      "start": 329.6,
      "duration": 5.039
    },
    {
      "text": "There are a few reasons why overwhelm is",
      "start": 332.24,
      "duration": 4.48
    },
    {
      "text": "so common here.",
      "start": 334.639,
      "duration": 4.241
    },
    {
      "text": "So your system is already working really",
      "start": 336.72,
      "duration": 4.4
    },
    {
      "text": "hard.",
      "start": 338.88,
      "duration": 4.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Managing symptoms, regulating energy,",
      "start": 341.12,
      "duration": 4.4
    },
    {
      "text": "processing uncertainty,",
      "start": 343.44,
      "duration": 4.72
    },
    {
      "text": "all of that uses capacity.",
      "start": 345.52,
      "duration": 4.48
    },
    {
      "text": "Things like poor breathing, which is",
      "start": 348.16,
      "duration": 4.08
    },
    {
      "text": "very common here, also causes our system",
      "start": 350.0,
      "duration": 4.24
    },
    {
      "text": "to work inefficiently.",
      "start": 352.24,
      "duration": 4.08
    },
    {
      "text": "So, we may be working way harder than we",
      "start": 354.24,
      "duration": 4.399
    },
    {
      "text": "need to.",
      "start": 356.32,
      "duration": 4.08
    },
    {
      "text": "When the nervous system feels unsafe,",
      "start": 358.639,
      "duration": 3.761
    },
    {
      "text": "our unconscious tasks in our body, such",
      "start": 360.4,
      "duration": 6.32
    },
    {
      "text": "as digestion, don't work as smoothly.",
      "start": 362.4,
      "duration": 6.96
    },
    {
      "text": "So, we're working hard",
      "start": 366.72,
      "duration": 6.12
    },
    {
      "text": "just to exist.",
      "start": 369.36,
      "duration": 3.48
    },
    {
      "text": "Your threat detection system is more",
      "start": 373.28,
      "duration": 6.32
    },
    {
      "text": "sensitive. So after illness or trauma,",
      "start": 375.919,
      "duration": 6.801
    },
    {
      "text": "the nervous system doesn't feel safe. It",
      "start": 379.6,
      "duration": 5.599
    },
    {
      "text": "becomes quicker to interpret things as",
      "start": 382.72,
      "duration": 4.24
    },
    {
      "text": "danger.",
      "start": 385.199,
      "duration": 4.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The body feels more unsafe more of the",
      "start": 386.96,
      "duration": 4.64
    },
    {
      "text": "time, spending more time in a fightlight",
      "start": 389.199,
      "duration": 4.961
    },
    {
      "text": "response, which means we're already way",
      "start": 391.6,
      "duration": 5.68
    },
    {
      "text": "closer to that overwhelm.",
      "start": 394.16,
      "duration": 5.394
    },
    {
      "text": "Again, it's not because you're weak,",
      "start": 397.28,
      "duration": 4.08
    },
    {
      "text": "[snorts] but because your system is",
      "start": 399.554,
      "duration": 5.846
    },
    {
      "text": "trying to keep you safe.",
      "start": 401.36,
      "duration": 4.04
    },
    {
      "text": "You're also often juggling invisible",
      "start": 405.759,
      "duration": 4.801
    },
    {
      "text": "tasks,",
      "start": 408.08,
      "duration": 4.959
    },
    {
      "text": "planning rest, pacing, monitoring",
      "start": 410.56,
      "duration": 4.479
    },
    {
      "text": "symptoms, navigating appointments,",
      "start": 413.039,
      "duration": 4.16
    },
    {
      "text": "managing expectations.",
      "start": 415.039,
      "duration": 4.16
    },
    {
      "text": "You feel the need to explain yourself to",
      "start": 417.199,
      "duration": 3.361
    },
    {
      "text": "others, which can be hard and",
      "start": 419.199,
      "duration": 3.44
    },
    {
      "text": "uncomfortable. You often have to",
      "start": 420.56,
      "duration": 4.16
    },
    {
      "text": "advocate for yourselves and have those",
      "start": 422.639,
      "duration": 4.481
    },
    {
      "text": "extra conversations.",
      "start": 424.72,
      "duration": 4.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Things aren't necessarily",
      "start": 427.12,
      "duration": 3.919
    },
    {
      "text": "straightforward in the way that they may",
      "start": 428.96,
      "duration": 4.959
    },
    {
      "text": "have felt before you became unwell. And",
      "start": 431.039,
      "duration": 6.241
    },
    {
      "text": "it's a lot.",
      "start": 433.919,
      "duration": 7.041
    },
    {
      "text": "And then recovery itself is emotional.",
      "start": 437.28,
      "duration": 8.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Hope, fear, grief, frustration, longing,",
      "start": 440.96,
      "duration": 9.44
    },
    {
      "text": "these all take up emotional space and we",
      "start": 446.08,
      "duration": 8.08
    },
    {
      "text": "often struggle to process these emotions",
      "start": 450.4,
      "duration": 6.32
    },
    {
      "text": "because they can feel uncomfortable",
      "start": 454.16,
      "duration": 5.28
    },
    {
      "text": "and we tend to disconnect from our body",
      "start": 456.72,
      "duration": 5.28
    },
    {
      "text": "rather than lean in.",
      "start": 459.44,
      "duration": 4.879
    },
    {
      "text": "This can cause emotions to become stuck",
      "start": 462.0,
      "duration": 4.0
    },
    {
      "text": "rather than moving them through the",
      "start": 464.319,
      "duration": 3.761
    },
    {
      "text": "body, which contributes to this",
      "start": 466.0,
      "duration": 5.08
    },
    {
      "text": "overwhelm.",
      "start": 468.08,
      "duration": 3.0
    },
    {
      "text": "So again, overwhelm isn't a sign that",
      "start": 471.44,
      "duration": 5.199
    },
    {
      "text": "you're going backwards. It's a sign that",
      "start": 473.52,
      "duration": 7.679
    },
    {
      "text": "your nervous system needs support.",
      "start": 476.639,
      "duration": 9.0
    },
    {
      "text": "That your needs are not being met.",
      "start": 481.199,
      "duration": 4.44
    },
    {
      "text": "So how can we work to avoid overwhelm?",
      "start": 486.639,
      "duration": 6.721
    },
    {
      "text": "I often talk about awareness being the",
      "start": 490.879,
      "duration": 5.76
    },
    {
      "text": "first step because if we start to notice",
      "start": 493.36,
      "duration": 6.0
    },
    {
      "text": "that things are building up, then we can",
      "start": 496.639,
      "duration": 5.201
    },
    {
      "text": "take steps to intervene to reduce that",
      "start": 499.36,
      "duration": 4.64
    },
    {
      "text": "load a little.",
      "start": 501.84,
      "duration": 4.639
    },
    {
      "text": "If we don't notice, then it can feel",
      "start": 504.0,
      "duration": 4.879
    },
    {
      "text": "like overwhelm hits out of nowhere and",
      "start": 506.479,
      "duration": 5.601
    },
    {
      "text": "then it can take you out.",
      "start": 508.879,
      "duration": 5.361
    },
    {
      "text": "So, taking time to check in with your",
      "start": 512.08,
      "duration": 6.079
    },
    {
      "text": "body is an incredibly powerful tool.",
      "start": 514.24,
      "duration": 5.679
    },
    {
      "text": "making sure to check in from a place of",
      "start": 518.159,
      "duration": 3.281
    },
    {
      "text": "curiosity",
      "start": 519.919,
      "duration": 4.741
    },
    {
      "text": "rather than panic or fear.",
      "start": 521.44,
      "duration": 4.959
    },
    {
      "text": "[snorts] And if you do notice that",
      "start": 524.66,
      "duration": 4.14
    },
    {
      "text": "you're starting to feel on edge,",
      "start": 526.399,
      "duration": 4.801
    },
    {
      "text": "unsettled, unsafe,",
      "start": 528.8,
      "duration": 3.599
    },
    {
      "text": "maybe you're starting to feel",
      "start": 531.2,
      "duration": 2.72
    },
    {
      "text": "uncomfortable,",
      "start": 532.399,
      "duration": 3.921
    },
    {
      "text": "discomfort is increasing,",
      "start": 533.92,
      "duration": 5.039
    },
    {
      "text": "things are building up, and you're",
      "start": 536.32,
      "duration": 4.639
    },
    {
      "text": "starting to experience symptoms of fight",
      "start": 538.959,
      "duration": 4.32
    },
    {
      "text": "flight. That is the time to give",
      "start": 540.959,
      "duration": 4.401
    },
    {
      "text": "yourself space.",
      "start": 543.279,
      "duration": 5.521
    },
    {
      "text": "So, pausing, taking a few deep breaths,",
      "start": 545.36,
      "duration": 6.0
    },
    {
      "text": "sensory grounding, anything that helps",
      "start": 548.8,
      "duration": 4.88
    },
    {
      "text": "you to feel a little bit like you're",
      "start": 551.36,
      "duration": 5.44
    },
    {
      "text": "taking a pause, a little bit safer.",
      "start": 553.68,
      "duration": 6.24
    },
    {
      "text": "It might be a micro pause. Often, that's",
      "start": 556.8,
      "duration": 4.719
    },
    {
      "text": "enough.",
      "start": 559.92,
      "duration": 3.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Or you may have time to stop and do a",
      "start": 561.519,
      "duration": 5.841
    },
    {
      "text": "longer breath practice, for example.",
      "start": 563.44,
      "duration": 7.2
    },
    {
      "text": "The important thing is to notice and to",
      "start": 567.36,
      "duration": 6.426
    },
    {
      "text": "send your body those signals of safety.",
      "start": 570.64,
      "duration": 3.44
    },
    {
      "text": ">> [snorts]",
      "start": 573.786,
      "duration": 3.974
    },
    {
      "text": ">> If we do this, then the escalation stops",
      "start": 574.08,
      "duration": 6.319
    },
    {
      "text": "and the system doesn't get to the point",
      "start": 577.76,
      "duration": 4.88
    },
    {
      "text": "where it's totally overwhelmed and shuts",
      "start": 580.399,
      "duration": 4.721
    },
    {
      "text": "down.",
      "start": 582.64,
      "duration": 4.639
    },
    {
      "text": "It involves finding the practices that",
      "start": 585.12,
      "duration": 5.279
    },
    {
      "text": "help you in those moments and then",
      "start": 587.279,
      "duration": 6.721
    },
    {
      "text": "practice. A practice of awareness and",
      "start": 590.399,
      "duration": 6.641
    },
    {
      "text": "then of intervening.",
      "start": 594.0,
      "duration": 5.519
    },
    {
      "text": "Sometimes it'll work, sometimes it",
      "start": 597.04,
      "duration": 5.76
    },
    {
      "text": "won't. But with practice, it gets a lot",
      "start": 599.519,
      "duration": 4.961
    },
    {
      "text": "easier,",
      "start": 602.8,
      "duration": 4.719
    },
    {
      "text": "we start to know intuitively what we",
      "start": 604.48,
      "duration": 6.039
    },
    {
      "text": "need.",
      "start": 607.519,
      "duration": 3.0
    },
    {
      "text": "So in that moment of overwhelm,",
      "start": 611.68,
      "duration": 7.12
    },
    {
      "text": "so you do become overwhelmed. Sometimes",
      "start": 615.92,
      "duration": 5.68
    },
    {
      "text": "it happens. It's not your fault. You",
      "start": 618.8,
      "duration": 5.422
    },
    {
      "text": "didn't do it deliberately.",
      "start": 621.6,
      "duration": 5.28
    },
    {
      "text": "[snorts] It's part of the process. and",
      "start": 624.222,
      "duration": 4.978
    },
    {
      "text": "learning to treat yourself kindly in",
      "start": 626.88,
      "duration": 4.8
    },
    {
      "text": "that moment will serve you well in",
      "start": 629.2,
      "duration": 6.16
    },
    {
      "text": "recovery and beyond.",
      "start": 631.68,
      "duration": 6.32
    },
    {
      "text": "So, here are some gentle practical tools",
      "start": 635.36,
      "duration": 4.88
    },
    {
      "text": "that you can use when that overwhelm",
      "start": 638.0,
      "duration": 4.16
    },
    {
      "text": "hits.",
      "start": 640.24,
      "duration": 3.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Think of them as ways to give your",
      "start": 642.16,
      "duration": 4.88
    },
    {
      "text": "system a little bit more room, a little",
      "start": 644.16,
      "duration": 6.359
    },
    {
      "text": "bit more space.",
      "start": 647.04,
      "duration": 3.479
    },
    {
      "text": "So, number one, name what's happening.",
      "start": 651.279,
      "duration": 6.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Even something simple like saying,",
      "start": 654.8,
      "duration": 5.76
    },
    {
      "text": "\"I'm feeling overwhelmed.",
      "start": 657.839,
      "duration": 5.201
    },
    {
      "text": "My system is overloaded.",
      "start": 660.56,
      "duration": 4.32
    },
    {
      "text": "This feels like too much for me right",
      "start": 663.04,
      "duration": 3.6
    },
    {
      "text": "now.\"",
      "start": 664.88,
      "duration": 4.16
    },
    {
      "text": "Putting a name on it",
      "start": 666.64,
      "duration": 4.319
    },
    {
      "text": "reduces the internal pressure to push",
      "start": 669.04,
      "duration": 4.919
    },
    {
      "text": "through.",
      "start": 670.959,
      "duration": 3.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Number two, orient to the environment.",
      "start": 674.079,
      "duration": 6.401
    },
    {
      "text": "So, let your eyes land on three things",
      "start": 678.32,
      "duration": 7.92
    },
    {
      "text": "around you. A color, a shape, a texture.",
      "start": 680.48,
      "duration": 8.56
    },
    {
      "text": "You could reach out and touch them. This",
      "start": 686.24,
      "duration": 5.68
    },
    {
      "text": "tells your nervous system, \"We're here.",
      "start": 689.04,
      "duration": 6.44
    },
    {
      "text": "We're safe enough.\"",
      "start": 691.92,
      "duration": 3.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Number three, reducing input.",
      "start": 695.6,
      "duration": 5.919
    },
    {
      "text": "So, you don't need to solve everything.",
      "start": 699.2,
      "duration": 4.48
    },
    {
      "text": "We just want to reduce.",
      "start": 701.519,
      "duration": 3.76
    },
    {
      "text": "So, it might be turning down the lights",
      "start": 703.68,
      "duration": 4.32
    },
    {
      "text": "if they're very bright, or removing",
      "start": 705.279,
      "duration": 5.361
    },
    {
      "text": "yourself from your screen,",
      "start": 708.0,
      "duration": 5.12
    },
    {
      "text": "step into another room,",
      "start": 710.64,
      "duration": 4.4
    },
    {
      "text": "pausing a conversation that's",
      "start": 713.12,
      "duration": 5.36
    },
    {
      "text": "challenging, close your eyes,",
      "start": 715.04,
      "duration": 6.56
    },
    {
      "text": "put your phone down, sit down, or lie",
      "start": 718.48,
      "duration": 5.2
    },
    {
      "text": "down.",
      "start": 721.6,
      "duration": 5.359
    },
    {
      "text": "This isn't avoidance. It's regulation.",
      "start": 723.68,
      "duration": 8.599
    },
    {
      "text": "It's giving ourselves what we need.",
      "start": 726.959,
      "duration": 5.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Number four, use a micro pause. So I me",
      "start": 732.8,
      "duration": 6.0
    },
    {
      "text": "mentioned this already.",
      "start": 736.399,
      "duration": 6.081
    },
    {
      "text": "One soft breath out, not a deep breath.",
      "start": 738.8,
      "duration": 6.56
    },
    {
      "text": "It might be a longer exhale.",
      "start": 742.48,
      "duration": 4.799
    },
    {
      "text": "It might be just paying attention to",
      "start": 745.36,
      "duration": 4.479
    },
    {
      "text": "your breath, connecting with your",
      "start": 747.279,
      "duration": 4.641
    },
    {
      "text": "diaphragm.",
      "start": 749.839,
      "duration": 5.12
    },
    {
      "text": "This signals safety. The breath is a",
      "start": 751.92,
      "duration": 6.159
    },
    {
      "text": "super effective way of giving our body",
      "start": 754.959,
      "duration": 7.0
    },
    {
      "text": "those signals of safety.",
      "start": 758.079,
      "duration": 3.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Number five, bring in one point of",
      "start": 763.279,
      "duration": 4.881
    },
    {
      "text": "contact.",
      "start": 766.0,
      "duration": 3.839
    },
    {
      "text": "It might be placing a hand on your",
      "start": 768.16,
      "duration": 6.08
    },
    {
      "text": "chest, your belly, your collarbone,",
      "start": 769.839,
      "duration": 6.961
    },
    {
      "text": "feeling the warmth, feeling the",
      "start": 774.24,
      "duration": 4.8
    },
    {
      "text": "pressure,",
      "start": 776.8,
      "duration": 5.279
    },
    {
      "text": "letting your body know that you're here,",
      "start": 779.04,
      "duration": 7.239
    },
    {
      "text": "connecting in this moment.",
      "start": 782.079,
      "duration": 4.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Number six, shrink the moment. Overwhelm",
      "start": 786.88,
      "duration": 6.88
    },
    {
      "text": "often comes from the sense that",
      "start": 791.76,
      "duration": 5.28
    },
    {
      "text": "everything is happening at once.",
      "start": 793.76,
      "duration": 6.24
    },
    {
      "text": "So it might be a case of saying just",
      "start": 797.04,
      "duration": 4.799
    },
    {
      "text": "this moment,",
      "start": 800.0,
      "duration": 4.72
    },
    {
      "text": "just this next step, I don't need to do",
      "start": 801.839,
      "duration": 5.281
    },
    {
      "text": "everything. I just need to do the next",
      "start": 804.72,
      "duration": 7.119
    },
    {
      "text": "tiny thing. What is one thing I can do",
      "start": 807.12,
      "duration": 7.76
    },
    {
      "text": "right now that will help? What is one",
      "start": 811.839,
      "duration": 6.041
    },
    {
      "text": "thing?",
      "start": 814.88,
      "duration": 3.0
    },
    {
      "text": "And then number seven, step away from",
      "start": 818.079,
      "duration": 7.2
    },
    {
      "text": "the problem-solving brain.",
      "start": 821.279,
      "duration": 6.641
    },
    {
      "text": "So when we're overwhelmed, the brain",
      "start": 825.279,
      "duration": 6.0
    },
    {
      "text": "will try to fix, will try to analyze,",
      "start": 827.92,
      "duration": 5.599
    },
    {
      "text": "try to catastrophize.",
      "start": 831.279,
      "duration": 4.0
    },
    {
      "text": "All of these things are probably things",
      "start": 833.519,
      "duration": 5.041
    },
    {
      "text": "that you are familiar with",
      "start": 835.279,
      "duration": 5.281
    },
    {
      "text": "and none of them in this moment are",
      "start": 838.56,
      "duration": 4.24
    },
    {
      "text": "helpful.",
      "start": 840.56,
      "duration": 5.36
    },
    {
      "text": "So we can say not now. First we",
      "start": 842.8,
      "duration": 6.88
    },
    {
      "text": "regulate, then we think. So it's",
      "start": 845.92,
      "duration": 6.96
    },
    {
      "text": "important to return to safety first and",
      "start": 849.68,
      "duration": 5.44
    },
    {
      "text": "then our cognition will start to come",
      "start": 852.88,
      "duration": 5.36
    },
    {
      "text": "back online.",
      "start": 855.12,
      "duration": 8.279
    },
    {
      "text": "Important return to safety first.",
      "start": 858.24,
      "duration": 5.159
    },
    {
      "text": "So what helps longer term? Because we've",
      "start": 864.959,
      "duration": 6.0
    },
    {
      "text": "talked so far about why what overwhelm",
      "start": 867.76,
      "duration": 6.4
    },
    {
      "text": "is, why it happens. We've talked about",
      "start": 870.959,
      "duration": 5.521
    },
    {
      "text": "how to start avoiding it. We've talked",
      "start": 874.16,
      "duration": 5.44
    },
    {
      "text": "about what to do when it happens. But",
      "start": 876.48,
      "duration": 7.44
    },
    {
      "text": "how do we start to make longerterm",
      "start": 879.6,
      "duration": 6.88
    },
    {
      "text": "changes?",
      "start": 883.92,
      "duration": 5.12
    },
    {
      "text": "So overwhelm becomes less intense and",
      "start": 886.48,
      "duration": 5.039
    },
    {
      "text": "less frequent when your system feels",
      "start": 889.04,
      "duration": 5.359
    },
    {
      "text": "safer overall.",
      "start": 891.519,
      "duration": 4.88
    },
    {
      "text": "So working to keep noticing with",
      "start": 894.399,
      "duration": 5.041
    },
    {
      "text": "curiosity, continue to calm the nervous",
      "start": 896.399,
      "duration": 6.401
    },
    {
      "text": "system in the moment and over time it",
      "start": 899.44,
      "duration": 7.28
    },
    {
      "text": "will start to stick. So it's a process.",
      "start": 902.8,
      "duration": 6.24
    },
    {
      "text": "It takes time and it takes consistent",
      "start": 906.72,
      "duration": 5.44
    },
    {
      "text": "effort, but it will help and it will",
      "start": 909.04,
      "duration": 6.159
    },
    {
      "text": "start to become easier.",
      "start": 912.16,
      "duration": 5.84
    },
    {
      "text": "But it's that consistency that's so",
      "start": 915.199,
      "duration": 4.481
    },
    {
      "text": "important.",
      "start": 918.0,
      "duration": 5.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Finding what helps to calm the system.",
      "start": 919.68,
      "duration": 5.845
    },
    {
      "text": "noticing when you need to do it and",
      "start": 923.04,
      "duration": 6.44
    },
    {
      "text": "[snorts] doing it consistently.",
      "start": 925.525,
      "duration": 3.955
    },
    {
      "text": "So, some things that may help to support",
      "start": 929.76,
      "duration": 5.519
    },
    {
      "text": "this",
      "start": 933.519,
      "duration": 3.68
    },
    {
      "text": "pacing.",
      "start": 935.279,
      "duration": 4.401
    },
    {
      "text": "So, giving your system predictable rest",
      "start": 937.199,
      "duration": 6.241
    },
    {
      "text": "and not pushing beyond capacity. Saving",
      "start": 939.68,
      "duration": 6.159
    },
    {
      "text": "energy for healing. Doing things when",
      "start": 943.44,
      "duration": 4.959
    },
    {
      "text": "you have capacity, but allowing yourself",
      "start": 945.839,
      "duration": 6.601
    },
    {
      "text": "that rest when you don't.",
      "start": 948.399,
      "duration": 4.041
    },
    {
      "text": "boundaries,",
      "start": 952.48,
      "duration": 5.039
    },
    {
      "text": "reducing unnecessary demands. Ruthlessly",
      "start": 954.56,
      "duration": 6.079
    },
    {
      "text": "put yourself and your healing first.",
      "start": 957.519,
      "duration": 5.521
    },
    {
      "text": "You might believe it's selfish, but",
      "start": 960.639,
      "duration": 5.921
    },
    {
      "text": "remember the analogy of the oxygen mask.",
      "start": 963.04,
      "duration": 5.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Put [snorts] your own oxygen mask on",
      "start": 966.56,
      "duration": 6.279
    },
    {
      "text": "before helping others.",
      "start": 968.72,
      "duration": 4.119
    },
    {
      "text": "Co-regulation.",
      "start": 972.959,
      "duration": 4.481
    },
    {
      "text": "Being around people who feel safe, who",
      "start": 974.56,
      "duration": 5.44
    },
    {
      "text": "make you feel safe, who allow you to be",
      "start": 977.44,
      "duration": 4.88
    },
    {
      "text": "you, who don't put unnecessary",
      "start": 980.0,
      "duration": 5.759
    },
    {
      "text": "unnecessary expectations on you, people",
      "start": 982.32,
      "duration": 7.56
    },
    {
      "text": "who make you feel safe",
      "start": 985.759,
      "duration": 4.121
    },
    {
      "text": "and then meeting sensations with",
      "start": 990.32,
      "duration": 5.759
    },
    {
      "text": "curiosity rather than fear and panic. So",
      "start": 992.24,
      "duration": 6.719
    },
    {
      "text": "things like sematic tracking or mindful",
      "start": 996.079,
      "duration": 7.2
    },
    {
      "text": "practices can be really helpful here.",
      "start": 998.959,
      "duration": 7.201
    },
    {
      "text": "micro moments of joy.",
      "start": 1003.279,
      "duration": 5.601
    },
    {
      "text": "So it could be tiny sparks, tiny sparks",
      "start": 1006.16,
      "duration": 6.0
    },
    {
      "text": "that widen capacity. What tiny little",
      "start": 1008.88,
      "duration": 6.319
    },
    {
      "text": "thing gives you the littlest ghost of a",
      "start": 1012.16,
      "duration": 6.039
    },
    {
      "text": "smile?",
      "start": 1015.199,
      "duration": 3.0
    },
    {
      "text": "My favorite, letting go of perfection.",
      "start": 1018.24,
      "duration": 7.679
    },
    {
      "text": "Good enough is enough",
      "start": 1021.92,
      "duration": 7.68
    },
    {
      "text": "and reducing internal pressure.",
      "start": 1025.919,
      "duration": 7.441
    },
    {
      "text": "So, especially the shoulds,",
      "start": 1029.6,
      "duration": 6.16
    },
    {
      "text": "what are you putting that extra pressure",
      "start": 1033.36,
      "duration": 4.88
    },
    {
      "text": "on yourself? And is there a way to ease",
      "start": 1035.76,
      "duration": 4.96
    },
    {
      "text": "that? A lot of it may be stuff that",
      "start": 1038.24,
      "duration": 6.079
    },
    {
      "text": "you're not even aware of. And I did an",
      "start": 1040.72,
      "duration": 6.959
    },
    {
      "text": "episode recently with Amy Davis, who we",
      "start": 1044.319,
      "duration": 5.6
    },
    {
      "text": "talk specifically about this internal",
      "start": 1047.679,
      "duration": 4.161
    },
    {
      "text": "pressure.",
      "start": 1049.919,
      "duration": 4.801
    },
    {
      "text": "I found it really enlightening. So, that",
      "start": 1051.84,
      "duration": 6.199
    },
    {
      "text": "may be helpful.",
      "start": 1054.72,
      "duration": 3.319
    },
    {
      "text": "Recovery isn't about being perfect. It",
      "start": 1058.4,
      "duration": 6.08
    },
    {
      "text": "isn't about getting everything right.",
      "start": 1061.6,
      "duration": 5.36
    },
    {
      "text": "It's about listening and it's about",
      "start": 1064.48,
      "duration": 4.24
    },
    {
      "text": "learning.",
      "start": 1066.96,
      "duration": 4.56
    },
    {
      "text": "It's about recognizing overwhelm early",
      "start": 1068.72,
      "duration": 5.199
    },
    {
      "text": "and responding with kindness instead of",
      "start": 1071.52,
      "duration": 4.48
    },
    {
      "text": "force.",
      "start": 1073.919,
      "duration": 6.12
    },
    {
      "text": "And it is a process.",
      "start": 1076.0,
      "duration": 4.039
    },
    {
      "text": "So, if you're experiencing overwhelm",
      "start": 1081.2,
      "duration": 4.08
    },
    {
      "text": "right now",
      "start": 1083.2,
      "duration": 4.32
    },
    {
      "text": "or if it's been a frequent visitor",
      "start": 1085.28,
      "duration": 4.32
    },
    {
      "text": "lately,",
      "start": 1087.52,
      "duration": 5.279
    },
    {
      "text": "I want you to know this.",
      "start": 1089.6,
      "duration": 5.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Your system is doing its best with the",
      "start": 1092.799,
      "duration": 5.361
    },
    {
      "text": "capacity it has.",
      "start": 1095.12,
      "duration": 6.96
    },
    {
      "text": "And as capacity grows, slowly, gently,",
      "start": 1098.16,
      "duration": 5.519
    },
    {
      "text": "quietly,",
      "start": 1102.08,
      "duration": 3.68
    },
    {
      "text": "when we stop fighting ourselves and we",
      "start": 1103.679,
      "duration": 4.561
    },
    {
      "text": "start listening, being kinder to",
      "start": 1105.76,
      "duration": 5.919
    },
    {
